[2026-08-24T15:58:05.222Z] • A unit's purpose may be to act as a helper for some other unit which has
[2026-08-24T15:58:05.222Z]   a requirement dependency on it.
[2026-08-24T15:58:05.222Z] • A unit may be started when needed via activation (socket, path, timer,
